### Practical 05: Product CRUD API Tests

### 1. Welcome Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### 3. Filter by Category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=Electronics

### 4. Search Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?search=Keyboard

### 5. Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/1

### 6. Create New Product
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Pro Wireless",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 4999,
  "stock": 35
}

### 7. Update Product
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard RGB v2",
  "price": 3299,
  "stock": 20
}

### 8. Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/products/4
